---
layout: base.njk
bodyClass: home
pageType: home
homePile: true
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Los Angeles mail art, one postcard at a time"
  description: "ArtCard.LA is a finished public archive of 1,372 postcards by 746 artists mailed across Los Angeles from 2009–2015. Submissions are closed. Organized by ZIP code and neighborhood. Formerly LA-Artist.com."
---
<section class="pile-wrap" aria-labelledby="pile-h">
  <div class="pile" data-pile data-prefix="{{ pathPrefix }}" data-built="{{ homepage.pileDay }}">
    <noscript>
    {%- for c in homepage.pileFallback %}
      <a class="pile-card" href="{{ ('/art/' + c.slug + '/') | url }}" style="--x:{{ c.x }}%;--y:{{ c.y }}%;--r:{{ c.r }}deg;z-index:{{ c.z }}"><img src="{{ ('/assets/art/' + c.id + '-400.webp') | url }}" width="{{ c.w }}" height="{{ c.h }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="ArtCard by {{ c.artist }}{% if c.zip %}, ZIP {{ c.zip }}{% endif %}"></a>
    {%- endfor %}
    </noscript>
  </div>
  <div class="pile-cap">
    <h1 id="pile-h">ArtCard: Los Angeles, one postcard at a time</h1>
    <p>A different handful from the shoebox every day. Pick any card to see it up close.</p>
  </div>
  <script type="application/json" id="pile-cards">{{ homepage.pileCards | dump | replace("</", "<\\/") | safe }}</script>
</section>
<script type="module" src="{{ '/assets/js/pile.js' | url }}"></script>

<section class="intro">
  <p>ArtCard.LA is a finished public archive of 1,372 postcards by 746 artists mailed across Los Angeles from 2009–2015. Submissions are closed.</p>
  <p>From 2009 to 2015, volunteers left blank, pre-addressed postcards in coffee shops, galleries, libraries, community centers and schools across Los Angeles County. People turned each one into a free 4″ × 6″ canvas, wrote their name and ZIP code on the front, and mailed it back.</p>
  <p class="stats">{{ groups.stats.artworks }} ArtCards · {{ groups.stats.artists }} artists · {{ groups.stats.zips }} ZIP codes · {{ groups.stats.neighborhoods }} neighborhoods</p>
  <p class="cta"><a class="btn" href="{{ '/map/' | url }}">Explore the map</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="{{ '/zips/' | url }}">Browse by ZIP</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="{{ '/artists/' | url }}">Artists A–Z</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="{{ '/books/' | url }}">Books</a> <a class="btn ig" href="https://www.instagram.com/artcard.la/"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="1.5" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg>Instagram</a></p>
</section>

<section class="mapwrap">
  <h2>Where the cards came from</h2>
  <div id="map" class="map" data-prefix="{{ pathPrefix }}" role="region" aria-label="Map of LA County ZIP codes shaded by number of ArtCards"></div>
  <p class="note">Darker ZIP codes sent in more cards. Tap a ZIP to see its cards. <a href="{{ '/map/' | url }}">Full-screen map</a></p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>From the collection <button class="shuffle" id="shuffle" type="button">Shuffle</button></h2>
  <div id="wall" data-prefix="{{ pathPrefix }}">
  {% set items = groups.art | take(30) %}{% include "grid.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-books" aria-labelledby="home-books-h">
  <div class="home-covers">
    <a href="{{ '/books/' | url }}"><img src="{{ '/assets/books/artcard-volume-1.webp' | url }}" width="401" height="401" alt=""></a>
    <a href="{{ '/books/' | url }}"><img src="{{ '/assets/books/artcard-volume-2.webp' | url }}" width="401" height="255" alt=""></a>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h2 id="home-books-h">Books</h2>
    <p>ArtCard Volume 1 and Volume 2, published in 2014, are still available in print and as a free digital edition on MagCloud.</p>
    <p class="cta" style="margin-top:10px"><a class="btn ghost" href="{{ '/books/' | url }}">See the books</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ '/assets/vendor/leaflet/leaflet.css' | url }}">
<script src="{{ '/assets/vendor/leaflet/leaflet.js' | url }}"></script>
<script src="{{ '/assets/js/map.js' | url }}"></script>
<script src="{{ '/assets/js/wall.js' | url }}"></script>
